# Files/dirs the EAS build ignores when packing the project archive.
# Same shape as .gitignore. Only affects what gets uploaded to EAS; the git
# repo and local dev tree are untouched.
#
# EVERYTHING that isn't runtime lives under mobile/store/ (Play/App Store
# screenshots, capcut stills, review videos, debug drops from adb screencap
# and the like). Keep it one line here — one place to look, one place to add
# to. If a new non-runtime folder shows up under mobile/, move it into store/
# rather than adding a new rule.
store/

# Local caches — Expo's own build/dev output, never part of the shipped app.
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
